## Frontend Structure

```
frontend/src/
  app/                        # layout.tsx (QueryProvider), page.tsx (WizardContainer)
  components/
    wizard/                   # StepIndicator, WizardContainer (state machine)
    upload/                   # FileUploader, ExcelPreview
    connection/               # ConnectionForm, TableSelector
    mapping/                  # ColumnMapper, MappingRow, TemplateSelector
    preview/                 # PreviewTable, ValidationErrors, LookupResolutions, ConfirmUpload
    templates/               # SaveTemplateDialog
    ui/                      # shadcn primitives (button, card, select, table, badge, dialog, etc.)
  hooks/                      # useUploadExcel, useSchema, useMappingSuggestions, usePreview,
                             # useCommit, useTemplates
  lib/                        # api.ts (axios client)
  types/                      # All TypeScript interfaces mirroring backend DTOs
  providers/                  # QueryProvider (TanStack Query)
```

